          <a href="#t6-vs-t9" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">8. Bowflex T6 vs T9: Who Should Pay the Extra</a>
          <a href="#t6-vs-sole-f63" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">9. Bowflex T6 vs Sole F63: Near-Identical on Paper</a>
          <a href="#bxt6-and-used" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">10. The BXT6 Name and Buying a T6 Used</a>
